Subject: The Rousseeuw Prize 2026 awarded to The  R Project
Message-ID: <A2208B5A-BCCB-4AAF-BA57-E9E2AEE7C0B3@cbs.dk>

The R Project has been awarded the Rousseeuw Prize. The prize goes with 50% to five members of the Core Team who the Jury has decided to have made the longest and most sustained contributions: Brian Ripley, Martin Maechler, Kurt Hornik, Peter Dalgaard, and 
Luke Tierney. The other 50% goes to the other members of the Core Team.

Further details, press releases and such, can be found on the website https://rousseeuwprize.org <https://rousseeuwprize.org/>.

